OL,3,ABlack and African cinema hub opens in
OL,4,ALondon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new black and African cinema and hub
OL,7,Fhas officially opened in south-west
OL,8,FLondon.
OL,10,FEbonyLife Place, based near Nine Elms,
OL,11,Fwas unveiled with a ceremony attended
OL,12,Fby the Mayor of London Lord Khan, and
OL,13,Fits founder Mo Abudu.
OL,15,FAbudu, a Nigerian media mogul who was
OL,16,Fborn in London, explained that the
OL,17,Fproject was born from a desire to
OL,18,Fshowcase and celebrate stories that she
OL,19,Ffelt previously lacked a home.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
